<title>USA: PhyCor expands with Dallas acquisitions.</title>
<headline>PhyCor expands with Dallas acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>PhyCor Inc said on Wednesday it acquired SPACO Management Co Inc and certain assets of Southwest Physician Associates.</p>
<p>SPACO is an independent practice association management company, while Southwest Physician is a 972-physician independent practice association, PhyCor said. Both companies are based in Dallas.</p>
<p>In addition, PhyCor also entered into a long-term management service agreement with Southwest Physician.</p>
<p>Other terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
